      <h1 id="bpfman-operator-install" class="group scroll-mt-20">Installing the eBPF Manager Operator<a href="#bpfman-operator-install" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h1>
      <p class="_abstract">To manage eBPF programs across your cluster nodes, you can install the eBPF Manager Operator by using the OpenShift Container Platform CLI or the web console. This Operator provides a standardized way to deploy, monitor, and secure eBPF-based networking and observability tools.</p>
      <Alert variant="info" class="my-4">
